			<div class="content" id="post-content-2790319">
									

<p>This is honestly so good, like woah. I feel like I understand my trans friends and how they feel better after reading this.</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">On another note, can I use the template (code) for the pagers for another tale?</span></p>

